# Auth — pick ONE option. Priority is Gemini > Anthropic API > Agent SDK.
#
# Option A (recommended for free): Google Gemini 2.5 Flash.
#   Free tier, no credit card, ~15 RPM is plenty for personal use.
#   Get a key from https://aistudio.google.com → "Get API key".
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
#
# Option B: Anthropic API key (pay-as-you-go billing, claude-opus-4-7).
#   Get it from https://console.anthropic.com → Settings → API keys.
#   Must start with sk-ant- and be a real key — placeholders are ignored.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
#
# Option C: Claude Pro/Max subscription via local Claude Code CLI.
#   1. npm install -g @anthropic-ai/claude-code
#   2. claude login   (opens browser; logs in with your claude.ai account)
#   3. Leave the two keys above unset.
#   The chat route falls back to the Claude Agent SDK and reuses your
#   `claude login` credentials. Currently doesn't work reliably inside
#   Next.js webpack — prefer Option A or B until that's solved upstream.

# M4 — Pronunciation assessment (optional; required for /pronunciation).
AZURE_SPEECH_KEY=
AZURE_SPEECH_REGION=eastus

# DB file location (defaults to ./data/coach.db).
DB_PATH=./data/coach.db
